@startuml
title US020 - "As a User, I want to get a list of the publicly \npublished lists of a given genre" - SSD
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

autonumber
autoactivate off

actor User
participant "MiteLovers" as System

User -> System: I want to get a list (name and user) of the \npublicly published lists of a given genre
System --> User: Select genreId
User -> System: genreId
System --> User: Here's your list!

@enduml